msgid "collab::ToggleProjectMenu"
msgstr "Schaltet das Dropdown-Menü des Projekts um."

#. Toggles the user menu dropdown.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "collab::ToggleUserMenu"
msgstr "Schaltet das Benutzermenü-Dropdown um."

#. Toggles the command palette.
